  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5906.09 Vehicle License Renewal Process. Any currently licensed EMS vehicle in this state shall be eligible for renewal in accordance with Saf-C 5906.01 and Saf-C 5906.03.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
